sequenceDiagram
  participant Caller
  participant Host
  participant Peer

  Host->>Host: mint Cap
  Caller->>Host: submit Intent under Cap
  Host->>Host: verify Cap
  alt verify fails or once-store down
    Host-->>Caller: Result error fail closed
  else verify ok
    Host->>Host: dispatch action
    Host->>Host: record lineage if required
    Host-->>Caller: Result with Ops
    Caller->>Peer: deliver Ops
    Peer->>Peer: apply Ops under profile
  end
